      "writtenOn": "2023-07-21T18:33:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "True, but we don\u0027t want it to be too short, otherwise we risk false positives. Also, this matches the guybrush value:\n\n```\n/* This timeout begins after CONFIG_SLEEP_TIMEOUT_MS */\n#define HARD_SLEEP_HANG_TIMEOUT 10000\n```\n\nI\u0027m going to keep this value for now, and we can reduce it if we find the user experience isn\u0027t good.",
      "parentUuid": "9fc27845_07fd68e4",
      "revId": "0c59ebedbca4b61cc3aee2dfa86638cee4724d85",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
